fficiency.\n- **Monitor Burn Rate**: Evaluate resource allocation and task prioritization to ensure sustainable work practices.\n- **Capacity Management**: Consider re-evaluating team capacity and workload distribution to maintain consistent velocity and reduce burn rate.",
